<title>USA: U.S. coffee roastings fall in latest week.</title>
<headline>U.S. coffee roastings fall in latest week.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Complete Coffee Coverage reported U.S. green coffee roastings as follows:</p>
<p>For the week ended May 3, roastings totaled approximately 285,000 60-kg bags, down from 315,000 bags the previous week and compared with 285,000 bags in the corresponding week one year ago.</p>
<p>Cumulative roastings totaled 5,995,000 60-kg bags, versus 5,865,000 bags in the same year ago period.</p>
<p>((-- New York Commodity Desk +1 212 859 1640))</p>
